    "_halftime_note": "Hip-Hop and Ghetto Tech are deliberately FULL-TIME (140-150, the DJ convention) rather than half-time (70-75, how SoundCloud's own tags read them). Trap written as 140 beatmatches against Jersey and ATL club without mental arithmetic. If you'd rather see 70 in Rekordbox, change Hip-Hop to [62, 102] and Ghetto Tech to [66, 82], then re-run detect_bpm.py --redetect."
